From 2b365633123b0b4b7e7fe4f040058538e194ac1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Liu <liuer@nvidia.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 21:50:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] nvidia-gpu: add SMA leak detector associations

Publish the association naming the inventory item each SMA leak
detector monitors, and an object manager so the mapper indexes the
detectors.

Key changes:
- src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuSensorMain.cpp: adds an object manager on
  the state namespace.
- src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaSmaLeakSensor.cpp: publishes a monitoring
  association from each detector to the inventory item it monitors.
- src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaSmaLeakSensor.hpp: holds the association
  interfaces for the lifetime of the detector.

